      "source_context": []
    },
    {
      "claim": "The key flow is search-to-synthesis evidence capture. The search artifact records the query, limit, command invocation, degradations, code citation targets, and ranked hybrid results for “reciprocal rank fusion hybrid search,” preserving both BM25 and semantic explanations along with fusion keys, snippets, source paths, titles, and wiki pages (docs/evidence/wiki-parity-2026-06/wp3-search-sources.json:1-49).",
